<title>USA: Alliance Broadcasting sets reverse split.</title>
<headline>Alliance Broadcasting sets reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Broadcasting Group Inc said it approved a reverse one for 5.4 split of its class A common stock to be distributed May 5, to stockholders of record on April 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Alliance Broadcasting owns and operates radio stations.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
